WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.157
As you work through the examples, pay attention to how the data is being accessed.

00:00:05.157 --> 00:00:09.582
With a dictionary, ask which key identifies the value.

00:00:09.582 --> 00:00:15.811
With a set, ask what duplicates disappear or what group comparison is being performed.

00:00:16.442 --> 00:00:22.079
Run the code, then change one key, one value, or one set item.

00:00:22.079 --> 00:00:26.303
Small experiments will make the behavior much easier to remember.
